{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Undertone 是一款語音日記 App，讓你在手機上直接口述記錄，並以內建 Whisper AI 在裝置內完成轉錄，音訊與文字不會上傳至伺服器。它適合重視私隱、需要離線記錄想法的人。原價 US $0.99，目前限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-59.webp\">\n<h2>裝置內轉錄保障私隱</h2>\n<p>開啟後按下錄音即可口述內容，Whisper AI 會在手機的 Neural Engine 上即時轉成文字，無需連線。你可按需要選擇 Small、Medium 或 Large 模型，在速度與準確度之間取捨；亦能為條目加上標籤、在本機搜尋完整存檔，配合波形精準回放錄音與逐字稿。若想法延續，可把新錄音附加到既有條目，並以單一壓縮檔備份及還原整本日記。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-478-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-479-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-480-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-481-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-482-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-483-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Undertone – Voice Journal</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T00:44:22.597989+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":357,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T00:19:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T08:38:41.529298+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T00:38:35.910009+00:00","content_hash":"90787f17831ba2f8a3be1702d1193a406c21483801bade1a8123f908cdd4b33c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}